'docs.im_update_note':'All fields are optional, only provided fields are updated.','docs.im_update_param_status':'Status: active / inactive',
'docs.im_delete_note':'Deleting an account does not affect existing inbox records, but those inboxes will no longer be able to fetch emails.',
